{
  "_comment": "Unified home-screen taps for lnx-server (1920x1080): 19 tiles at real picker geometry plus the apps-dock (one tap opens the full grouped apps screen). Tile rects + dock are GENERATED -- never hand-edit them; recompute with: python3 renderers/unified.py --width <W> --height <H> --views <csv> (csv from the live set: same rule the daemon uses, see TOUCH.md; paste entries [1:] under \"view_regions\" -> \"unified\" -- entry [0] is the global screen-off badge, already live via \"regions\", and repeating its id would fail the announce uniqueness check). Tile ids carry a uview- prefix so the picker scope (view-*) and this scope never share an id. Validate with `python3 touch.py --config touch.json --check-views` before restarting displayd-touch. Revert: restore the backup (see TOUCH.md).",
